<title>JAPAN: Takefuji ask-only after share controversy.</title>
<headline>Takefuji ask-only after share controversy.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Takefuji Corp were ask-only on Monday morning after being battered on Friday by news that an ex-finance ministry official had bought shares in the firm before they were registered on the OTC market, traders said.</p>
<p>As of 0033 GMT, shares in the consumer finance firm were ask-only at 8,280 yen after closing at 8,480 yen on Friday.</p>
